          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "<center><b>Tuning advice on this dashboard is unlikely to be reliable until at least 24 hours of telemetry data has accumulated and you zoom out to at least 24 hours.</b></center>\n<center><b>If only some of your graphs are populated, but not all, you likely need to enable <code>innodb_monitor_enable=all</code>.  Check <a href=\"https://shatteredsilicon.net/software/ssm/documentation/latest/conf-mysql.html\" target=\"_blank\"> instructions </a> on how to configure MySQL for best results.</b></center>",
